      <blockquote data-en="Operators who switch to Bookwize from manual or phone-only booking consistently report no-show rates dropping from the 20-25% range to under 10% within the first month — without any change to their cancellation policy." data-fr="Les opérateurs qui passent à Bookwize depuis la réservation manuelle ou téléphonique rapportent systématiquement une baisse des taux d'absence de la fourchette 20-25% à moins de 10% dès le premier mois — sans aucun changement à leur politique d'annulation.">Operators who switch to Bookwize from manual or phone-only booking consistently report no-show rates dropping from the 20-25% range to under 10% within the first month — without any change to their cancellation policy.</blockquote>

      <h2 data-en="The Bottom Line on No-Show Statistics" data-fr="Conclusion sur les statistiques d'absence">The Bottom Line on No-Show Statistics</h2>

      <p data-en="The data on barbershop and salon no-shows points to one clear conclusion: the problem is large, the cost is significant, and the solution is well-established. Without automated reminders, 20-30% of your appointments will be lost to no-shows. With the right system in place — automated confirmation plus 24h reminder with confirm/cancel — that rate drops to 5-10%." data-fr="Les données sur les absences dans les barbershops et salons pointent vers une conclusion claire : le problème est important, le coût est significatif et la solution est bien établie. Sans rappels automatisés, 20 à 30% de vos rendez-vous seront perdus. Avec le bon système en place — confirmation automatisée plus rappel 24h avec confirmation/annulation — ce taux tombe à 5 à 10%.">The data on barbershop and salon no-shows points to one clear conclusion: the problem is large, the cost is significant, and the solution is well-established. Without automated reminders, 20-30% of your appointments will be lost to no-shows. With the right system in place — automated confirmation plus 24h reminder with confirm/cancel — that rate drops to 5-10%.</p>

      <p data-en="For a barbershop losing $13,000 per year to no-shows, reducing the rate from 25% to 8% would recover roughly $8,700 in annual revenue. That is the ROI of a reminder system — not a marketing campaign, not a new service, just making sure your existing clients actually show up." data-fr="Pour un barbershop perdant 13 000 $ par an à cause des absences, réduire ce taux de 25% à 8% permettrait de récupérer environ 8 700 $ de revenus annuels. C'est le retour sur investissement d'un système de rappel — pas une campagne marketing, pas un nouveau service, juste s'assurer que vos clients existants se présentent réellement.">For a barbershop losing $13,000 per year to no-shows, reducing the rate from 25% to 8% would recover roughly $8,700 in annual revenue. That is the ROI of a reminder system — not a marketing campaign, not a new service, just making sure your existing clients actually show up.</p>

